WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Confidence is not permission. Stop or escalate when consequence outruns evidence.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Declare consequence and evidence thresholds.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Stop when required controls fail.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Escalate uncertainty to a human.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Record the reason and fallback.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Govern when AI must not continue.
